    "description": "This scenario simulates a Kubernetes workload deployed with hostNetwork enabled, violating CIS Kubernetes Benchmark 5.2.4. The agent must detect the violation using kubectl and OPA and generate a policy to prevent it.",
    "disruptions": [
        {
            "injections": [
                {
                    "args": {
                        "kubernetesObject": {
